{"title":"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangular region is bounded by the graphs of the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e01d0114b268c0f142d64013a1b2f7446d54c8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=a, y=-b, x=-c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"176\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/8/e48af5d12d4180555c6c6b761696646008f7d826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=d$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b8490a47ba3063da2731316f5d65dc5cf731ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are all positive numbers. Which of the following represents the area of this region?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fe3ae5283cdada50c2eb0af0b996e5204e19dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ ac+ad+bc+bd\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ ac-ad+bc-bd\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ ac+ad-bc-bd   \\quad\\quad\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ -ac-ad+bc+bd\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ ac-ad-bc+bd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"1040\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have a rectangle of side lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0ac3fc24d21c85e8d9c759e9fb8d6a9a714551ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-(-b)=a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec509414e084df5c8f49a8977014dfe31f119ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-(-c)=c+d.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> Thus the area of this rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a251c46ceb5620fc7a602a91f42e0d8741fcf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b)(c + d) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ ac + ad + bc + bd}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"314\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/n0qUd4ukEF8\">https://youtu.be/n0qUd4ukEF8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=biR0pgefTCs&amp;t=2s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=biR0pgefTCs&amp;t=2s</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A\">2011 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td><